Description: Interactive, linked visualizations of spatial data held in
    'DuckDB' databases, such as 'GiottoDB' spatial omics datasets. A
    browser workspace built on 'SQL Rooms' creates and links maps, tables and
    charts without code, and an 'htmlwidgets' viewer combines 'Mosaic' views
    and 'deck.gl' layers over one 'DuckDB-WASM' instance and one selection, so
    a brush in any view filters the others. Results of queries on a 'DuckDB'
    connection reach the browser as 'Arrow' data written by 'DuckDB', without
    materialising the rows in R. Complements the 'rDeckgl' and 'rMosaic'
    packages. Both browser components load 'DuckDB-WASM' from a public content
    delivery network, so using them requires internet access.
